Pier 54 is a dock in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], along the run-down riverfront where the warehouses and dockyards give way to the water. The half-giant at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|The Crowded Flea]] sent those asking after [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn]] to meet him here in the evening.
